WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.110
You started a business, not a second job:
connecting everything, all the time.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:14.940
A request here, a quote there, information everywhere…
and you in the middle.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:19.940
What if everything finally worked together?
That is OPSYS-AI’s ambition.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:29.490
Connecting reception to sales, estimates to the field,
materials to finance,

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.490
and your company’s facts
to your marketing and your decisions.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.250
Specialized agents to coordinate,
business rules to calculate,

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.250
human approvals to stay in control.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:53.150
A memory to find the context again,
an overview to see what matters

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.150
and what needs your decision.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:06.260
Less scattering, more direction.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:10.260
OPSYS-AI: your whole company moving as one.

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:14.260
Discover OPSYS-AI.
